{"id":"n36681-1-19","stage":0,"title":"비 · 雨","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36681-1-19-1","ko":"왜 그렇게 젖었어요?","zh":"怎么湿成这样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"젖었어요?","meaning":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","explanation":"젖다：沾湿，浸湿，润湿；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"젖다","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64729","senseId":"1","lemma":"젖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젖었어요","audio":"/audio/1bf43d73e97926722be3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"5f61a84f921197b6","term":"젖다","zh":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3","entryId":"64729","definition":"液体渗入，变得潮湿。","pronunciation":["젇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/267278d4d532474cd4b8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36681-1-19-2","ko":"갑자기 비가 오는데 우산이 없었거든요.","zh":"突然下起雨来，我当时没带伞。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"오는데","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는데","audio":"/audio/51958c7a1c8724a56ff3.mp3"}},{"text":"우산이","meaning":"雨伞","explanation":"우산：雨伞；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71103","senseId":"1","lemma":"우산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우산이","audio":"/audio/81c508d14c3a9a2f53c0.mp3"}},{"text":"없었거든요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었거든요","audio":"/audio/47a19e28799de70a46bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"8b6f9142a49be500","term":"우산","zh":"雨伞","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3","entryId":"71103","definition":"在长竿上铺上像遮盖物一样的膜，下雨时用手举着遮雨的工具。","pronunciation":["우ː산"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1cc7aef0e53dfd6c9e9c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.48,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=36681","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":16,"sequenceScore":0.5175,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["突然下起雨来，我当时没带伞。","怎么湿成这样了？","这次考试第一名是谁啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么湿成这样了？","这次考试第一名是谁啊？","突然下起雨来，我当时没带伞。"],"answer":2}]}
